window.products.push({"id":852040,"name":"Totally Topsy Turvy DVD set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517SSb3Zd9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Learn to create a beautiful Topsy Turvy cake as Cake Artist, Sharon Zambito, leads you through the entire process from start to finish. Learn everything from filling the tiers, carving and construction, down to every last decorating detail. This 2-disc set is a complete A to Z lesson on the Topsy Turvy cake. Bonus items include how to cut and serve a Topsy Turvy cake and out-takes from filming. Techniques taught include: Preparing and filling the cake layers and tiers, Carving the tiers to shape, Making and applying a ganache base coat, Covering the tiers in fondant using 2 different techniques, Stacking and supporting the tiers for ultimate stability, Cutting and applying side diamond pattern, Using a silicone push mold for accent decorations, Making and applying rope swags, Cutting and applying geometric circle pattern, Cutting and applying frill ribbon, Cutting and applying stripes, Making large bead border, Making and applying ribbon roses and leaves, Applying fondant balls on wires. Bonus section includes: Making and applying monogram topper, Making and applying curlie q decorations, Making and applying gold trumpet flowers. --Extra Bonus Items: How to cut and serve a Topsy Turvy cake; Out-takes from filming. --Please note: In this DVD, ganache is shown as the base coat under the fondant. However, the techniques taught are exactly the same for cakes iced in all buttercream, buttercream under fondant, or ganache under fondant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517SSb3Zd9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sugared Productions","source_asin":"B003FIZ35Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003FIZ35Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003FIZ35Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
