window.products.push({"id":852064,"name":"Messermeister Park Plaza Stiff Boning Knife, 6-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616wgJR6wkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Park Plaza knife collection is Messermeister’s stamped version of the triple-rivet, full exposed tang, German knife series. This collection is manufactured with one-piece, die-cut stamped blades using high quality German stainless steel alloy. The stamped blades do not have a bolster and are lighter than forged knives. Park Plaza knives are trimmed, straightened and hardened then attached to industrial quality handles that are buffed to a seamless fit and finish. Manufactured in the historical City of Blades, Solingen, Germany by cutlery artisans, these are a great value. An essential knife for butchers, the 6” Messermeister Park Plaza Boning Knife is designed to remove bones from meat, poultry and game. The tapered pointed blade provides excellent control and precision for cutting tasks that render maximum yield. The stamped German stainless steel blade guarantees razor like sharpness and longevity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616wgJR6wkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Messermeister","source_asin":"B003UY8KAU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003UY8KAU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003UY8KAU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":852065,"name":"Juicy Couture - 2 Piece Duvet Set, Juicy in Paris Bonjour Eiffel Tower Design Duvet, Twin Size, Set Includes 1 Duvet and 1 Shams, 100% Polyester, Reve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91f05wNgUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adding the Juicy Couture Juicy in Paris Duvet Set to your bedroom will instantly relax and transport you to Paris. The Juicy In Paris design brings a luxurious and stylish feeling into your home with an elegantly printed Paris and Eiffel Tower motifs, with the hassle-free ability to reverse at any time to a beautifully neutral grey color. You will feel elated getting into bed every night with the easily reversible, lightweight Duvet that is made from a high-quality polyester, keeping you cool and comfortable. Getting a good nights’ rest starts with having the best bedding, and with the Juicy In Paris Duvet Set, you will be well rested every night. Pick the size you need, these duvets come in Twin, Full/Queen, and King sizes. The Juicy in Paris collection is available in sheet sets and comforters, too, all offered in a beautiful Parisian print that encourages layering for a well-styled bed. Plus, cleaning your new favorite bedding is easier than ever! Toss the duvet and pillow shams in the washing machine on a cold, gentle cycle, use non chlorine bleach, and tumble dry low. Treat yourself to the best bedding decision you’ve ever made!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91f05wNgUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juicy Couture","source_asin":"B09TQBKVQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TQBKVQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TQBKVQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
