window.products.push({"id":852067,"name":"Faux Wood Grain Contact Paper Self Adhesive Vinyl Self Adhesive Shelf Liner Drawer Furniture Countertop Cabinet Sticker 16\" x 78.7\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719JmghvWLL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Renovating your cabinet, countertop, furniture table etc Just need purchase one roll contact paper, then stick the contact paper to flat place you want, it can make them looks like new one. Instruction for Use: 1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet, drawer, walls, window, glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature. 2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water. 3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is better. 4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out. Note: Please buy enough roll paper one time to avoid the effect of batch color difference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719JmghvWLL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walldecor1","source_asin":"B0BM4HM2W9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM4HM2W9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM4HM2W9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
