window.products.push({"id":852373,"name":"SEAREE Anime Poster, Japanese Anime Wall Art Posters, Anime Wall Decor, 5 Pcs HD Canvas Printing Posters for Living Room, Bedroom, Club Wall Art Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711SOpi8yeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Posters are everyone's favorite room decor.Our company uses HD transfer technology to print brightly colored anime characters on high-quality canvas,to be hang up the bedroom, kid's room, living room, office, dorm, and more.It make a pretty wall decor in any room, not only can beautify the environment, but also show the owner's taste and style from the side .Posters make great gifts as well.Whether it's for a Christmas stocking stuffer, a best friend's birthday, or a house warming gift, they'll love receiving a high-quality poster to show off. Product specifications Material : Canvas Size : 12x32in x1pcs，12x24in x2pcs，12x16in x2pcs （30x80cm x1pcs, 30x60cm x2pcs, 30x40cm x2pcs)No Frame Note :1.Due to the influence of light and screen, there may be slight color difference.2.The picture is for reference only and does not represent a scale. Please measure your place before purchase.3.This product is frameless. Installation method :一：You can contact with local carpenter or company and order some wooden frames which fit these canvases, each canvas has 1 inch white border for you to stretch on frames,fix the canvas on the picture frame and hang on the wall.二：You can use scissors to cut off the extra 1 inch white border canvas，fix the poster directly on the wall with double-sided tape.Please buy with confidence.If you have any quality problems with our animation posters,please feel free to contact us,we will reply you within 24 hours and provide you with the most satisfactory solution,customer satisfaction is our best return . Products will continue to be updated,so stay tuned.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711SOpi8yeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEAREE","source_asin":"B0BQMNNFP1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQMNNFP1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQMNNFP1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
