window.products.push({"id":852416,"name":"Personal Evaporative Mini Air Cooler, Portable Air Conditioner Fan with 3 Cooling Speeds, Water Tank, Type-C Input, Night Light for Room Home Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rd9U6AyTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"120° Oscillation 🎁 Perfect Gift for Summer 🆒💨 Efficient Cooling - Our portable air cooling fan is equipped with a high-performance motor, and 2 mist humidification holes, which are able to reduce the surrounding temperature up to 45-50℉ and instantly cool you down. Compact and portable design is suitable for home, office, kitchen, bedrooms, dorms, desk, or garage as well as RVs, cabins, outdoor tents, outdoor concerts, backyard places, tailgate parties, hunting, and camping. 🆒💨 3 Speeds & 2 Spray Setting - There are three different speed buttons, you can adjust the speed from high, medium, and low speed. Adjust the wind speed according to your own actual needs. Two different spray modes, you can choose an intermittent spray or continuous spray. ( Tips: We offer a detailed user manual on how to use each function if you have any more problems, please kindly let us know.) 🆒💨 120° Oscillation & Night Light - Our portable desktop air conditioner allows for wide and smooth oscillation, 120 degrees swing at any time and no longer have to worry about blowing for a long time. Providing you more efficient airflow distribution in your room. The air cooler can be also used as a night light, when you are going to sleep, you can set the night light function to make you sleep comfortably, give you a warm and comfortable night. 🆒💨 LCD Design & Energy Saving- The LCD screen design helps you to know the remaining power and wind speed of the product more quickly. The air cooler fan operates at low energy consumption, much cheaper than running a Freon air conditioner on hot summer days. Both space-efficient and economical. This kind of intelligent product not only looks good, but also has a lot of function. 🆒💨 Easy to Operate & Clean - This cooler is easy to operate, we have a detailed instruction manual for you to use and understand the product features more quickly. With and user-friendly design, you can take off the shell after using it for a period of time, and continue to use it after cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rd9U6AyTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aisillac","source_asin":"B09PBH4SBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PBH4SBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PBH4SBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
