window.products.push({"id":852427,"name":"SUKODIS Chair Covers for Dining Room, Velvet Stretch Chair Slipcover Protector for Upholstered Parsons Chairs, Decoration Chair Covers for Home, Hotel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518lEcsb3QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【Great Party Wedding Decoration & Chair Full Protection】: Multiple optional color With providing your Chair an alternative looks, It is perfect fit for various occasions such as Home Dining Room Hotel Wedding party or Home Decor. Stretchy Velvet slipcovers tight against your Chair easily and protect your favorite seat from youngsters, muddy paws, and the beverage spill. ✔【Premium Velvet Fabric】:AS one of the sleekest, softest man-made materials ever engineered, Crafted from 85% polyester and 15% spandex, this unique premium velvet fabric makes your slipcover comfortable cozy resilient and durable. Thanks to the unique dyeing technology, color can be unchanged after repeated washing. ✔【Available Size & Easy to Install】:TIPS: Please kindly MEASURE Chair and Choose the proper Size before Ordering. Suitable for Dining Chair With the following Dimension: The back of the chair: 19.8~28 inches high, 16~17 inches wide. The Chair seat is 14~19 inches long, 14~19 inches wide and 2~4 inches high. High Stretch Velvet fabric and all-around elastic help you easily complete the installation in one step. ✔【Best Way to Renew Your Dining Chair】: Dining Chair Covers Slipcover are a great way to bring back that lost love and feeling to your Dining chair, that same feeling you got when you first bought it. After several years of wear, pet scratches and some stubborn stains, all you really need to do is to re-cover it with our Dining Chair Cover. ✔【Easy Care & How to Remove Fabric Wrinkles】Machine Washable Covers Slipcover, Wash at or below 30 Degrees Celsius, Do not bleach, Do not iron. Kindly Note: Due to Different Monitor or screens, Colors may be slightly different as you see. The Fabric may have wrinkles due to extrusion during transportation. You only need to wash the product by hand, and then dry it naturally, the wrinkle of the product's fabric will disappear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518lEcsb3QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUKODIS","source_asin":"B0B19JPQYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B19JPQYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B19JPQYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
