window.products.push({"id":852568,"name":"TigerChef 0026-CATERSET Catering Set Serving Dishes for Parties Includes Chafer Pans Set and Disposable Serving Utensils, Spoons and Tongs for Parties","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":128.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cgy7sVCwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The best solution offering buffet-style service in a cost-effective combo box! We’ve included everything you need, featuring silver coloring and fine wire design for a contemporary look. Use this great chafer set to serve entrees and side dishes at weddings and graduations or for any outdoor party or catered event. Fill the pans with everything from salads to meats and casseroles! Our chafer pans are oven safe and come with compatible lids enabling them to be stacked and stored for advanced preparation. They can also go straight from the oven onto the chafer wire frames on your buffet! And it’s disposable too – that means no more washing tons of dishes after family gatherings, parties and catered events.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cgy7sVCwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiger Chef","source_asin":"B01N9KAQZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N9KAQZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N9KAQZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":852569,"name":"Isaac Jacobs Divided Clear Plastic Organizer (10.75” x 6.5” x 3.7”) w/Hinged Lid, Stackable Storage Box for Tea Bags, Crafts, Office Supplies, Cosmeti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TKEHo-HiS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SORT & ORGANIZE: Home and office organization is easy with the Isaac Jacobs divided section clear plastic organizer with a hinged lid. Goodbye messy kitchen cabinets or office desks and junk drawers filled with small items that make a huge mess. Save space & simplify storage with the clear, high-quality design of our plastic box that keeps small items organized throughout the house. 8 sections make it easy to store and separate tea bags, coffee pods, candy, snacks, jewelry, cosmetics, and more. STURDY DESIGN: This Isaac Jacobs hinged lid stackable storage box with compartments is made of high-quality plastic. The sturdy top opens and closes easily with a front tab for lifting the lid, giving access to items in the divided clear container like screws, nails, small batteries, paper clips, cotton balls, hair bands, toys, collectibles, instant photos, tea, and much more. There’s no latch to keep the clear organizer closed so it’s effortless to use. BPA-free and fridge / food safe. EASY STORAGE: With our Isaac Jacobs high-quality clear divided plastic box with lid, you can quickly find what you need or see when you’re low on stock. Separate tea bags in the kitchen, office supplies at work, and crafts with our unique stackable storage bin. Clean with soap and water. HAND-WASH ONLY. NOT DISHWASHER SAFE. Dimensions: 10.75” L x 6.5” W x 3.7” H, 1.2 lbs. (19.5 oz.); Section dimensions: 2.5” L x 2.75” W x 1.75” H (1.5” of space between the top of the dividers and the lid). CUSTOM ORGANIZATION: Mix and match our stylish Isaac Jacobs clear organizer bins with a hinged lid to create a custom stackable storage system for the kitchen, pantry, office, bathroom, & garage. With this divided section plastic container, you can organize stickers, labels, first aid, makeup in cabinets, or condiments, coffee pods, sugar/sweeteners on the counter. We also carry other plastic storage bins with or without compartments to stack on top of each other when closed to maximize space. MULTI-USE: Maximize space and improve organization by storing your items in our divided clear bin with a hinged lid. You can stack the Isaac Jacobs organizer containers on top of each other for vertical storage. Store bandages and pill / vitamin packets in your medicine cabinet, powdered drink mix and tea in the pantry, earrings and pins in your closet, acrylic nails and nail art in the bathroom, and doll and action figure accessories in children’s bedrooms. Your imagination sets the limit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TKEHo-HiS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B092RK6T1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092RK6T1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092RK6T1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
