window.products.push({"id":852712,"name":"Neoflam Eela low stockpot olive green, 2.5 qt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DncWdOXdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Neoflam Eela Stockpot Eela, winner of the 2012 iF Product Design Award, possesses a graceful pleated wall, seamlessly-integrated handles, and stylized Bakelite lid knob make it nothing short of functional artistry. Regarded as Neoflam's flagship cookware line, Eela is feature rich and extremely lightweight. Eela's cutting edge design and color make it the least boring piece of cookware in your arsenal. Eela's cast aluminum design provides multiple advantages over its competitors; known for its exceptional durability and high heat conductivity, cast aluminum is rising in popularity as a safe and affordable alternative to stainless steel. At just 1/3 the weight of cast iron, cast aluminum's even heat distribution properties allow for fast cooking and reduced energy consumption. Neoflam cookware is produced with Ecolon ceramic coating. This is an all-natural alternative to traditional nonstick coatings, and it is free of PTFE/PFOA. When Ecolon is applied to the cast aluminum body, the cookware transforms into a deliciously colorful piece with amazing features including a lightweight frame, a durable body, and a scratch resistant, easy to clean surface. Features: Cast aluminum body is lightweight and highly heat conductive Ecolon ceramic nonstick coating is made from all-natural materials Easy to clean and maintain Ecolon - The Healthy Choice for Nonstick Cookware Ecolon is Neoflam’s innovative nonstick ceramic coating made from all-natural materials. It is applied to the interior and exterior of our cookware, which extends the life of the product and ensures it is easy to use and maintain. The result is a healthier choice for people and the environment. Of course, it does not contain PTFE/PFOA. About Neoflam Neoflam has been at the forefront of cookware design and manufacturing since 2008. The combination of durable, lightweight cast aluminum and colorful ceramic coating brought early success as customers looked for new ways to liven up their kitchen. In 2014, Neoflam built a new factory in Korea, in addition to existing factories in China, that borrowed the latest industrial technologies from the automobile industry. This was to ensure Neoflam remains on the cutting edge of kitchen innovation while continuing to provide quality, products to our loyal customers all over the world. Neoflam - lighting a “new flame” in the kitchenware industry. Neoflam's leadership in product design has been recognized by the following prestigious design awards: iF (2012, 2016), Red Dot (2012, 2013, 2014), and Design Plus (2014).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DncWdOXdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neoflam","source_asin":"B00MGNDWR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MGNDWR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MGNDWR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":852713,"name":"Jero Commercial Spring Assisted Kitchen Shears with Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31aYL-ebZEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Jeru is a leading commercial cutlery manufacturer for the meat processing and food service industries, and one of the largest private label knife manufacturers producing cutlery for some of the world's largest knife brands. Jeru also manufacturers some of the most innovative and unique home lines of cutlery and kitchen tools, using the same commercial grade materials they use in their professional lines. The jerk spring assisted shears were designed originally for a major us kitchenware brand, but after millions of units sold and becoming one of the most popular kitchen shears, the us company was taken over by an investment company that decided more profit could be made having a copy of the shears made in china using low quality materials, buying them at a fraction of the cost of the original commercial grade. The price was increased, but the quality was reduced. Jeru is excited to be able to offer the original commercial grade spring assisted shears, still manufactured by jerk in Portugal, using German high-carbon stainless steel, tough impact resistant polymer handles, and industrial strength spring, to ensure years of use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31aYL-ebZEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jero Commercial","source_asin":"B01N3C3YZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N3C3YZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N3C3YZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
