window.products.push({"id":852719,"name":"Eucalyptus Garland with Baby Breath Flower, Green Silver Dollar Leaves, Fake Stem, 6 Feet Realistic; Artificial Plants Wedding Background, Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yhMW2poeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This elegant, classy, and beautiful eucalyptus garland is the perfect decoration for your  - Wedding backgrounds - Party table centerpieces - Outdoor space decorations - Indoor home decor The green leaves look natural , and the flexible vine can be shaped and bent. It is a simple garland that you can customize with accent flowers.  This garland doesn’t just look nice, but it adds instant beauty and attractiveness to your space. Each vine has more than 145 leaves so it looks full and plush . The garland is handmade , so leaves can be removed and put back if you want. You have the option of buying a 1 piece or 2 piece pack for the eucalyptus garland. The eucalyptus garland with baby breath only comes in 1 piece packs.  This low-maintenance garland is made of silk and plastic, meaning it won't get easily damaged, fade, or attract bugs .These are some suggestions for using a eucalyptus garland:1.Roll the garland to make a wreath! You can hang it on your door or on a sidewall to accent your space.  2.Use it as a table runner and add candles, flowers, berries, to accent the table.  3.Place it along stair railings, window sills, around a window, or along a fire place for a cozy and rustic feel.4.Use it in a wedding along the back row pews or chairs, or along the aisle.Lehua Decor is a new small mom-and-pop shop based out of Hawai'i. We believe the spaces we occupy should look beautiful . We understand you can't always decorate a space with real plants, so we’re providing a better alternative. We also understand we should properly steward the finite resources we have, and that sustainment begins at the local level. Therefore, 2% of all our profits are donated to support local non-profit organizations committed to sustaining communities in Hawai'i and the country where this product is made.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yhMW2poeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lehua Decor","source_asin":"B07SWX7315","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SWX7315","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SWX7315","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
