window.products.push({"id":852735,"name":"SLIM CADDY Middy Caddy Cabinet Organizer |Optimize Your Cabinet Space | Cabinet Door Organizer | Spice Organizer, Bathroom Accessories, Under Sink Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YVj2dTu4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑️ OPTIMAL CABINET DOOR ORGANIZER FOR MORE ROOM: Balanced design takes up minimal cabinet space, while providing a moderate amount of storage room. Great for cabinets with a little more free space! No unsightly hangers exposed when your cabinets are closed and not a good fit in your cabinets (like over door organizers). No permanent holes or other damage to your cabinets. No using up all your interior cabinet space for organizing, like other cabinet organizers (you need that space for the drink cups and food containers, not the lids)! ☑️ CONVENIENT ACCESS and VISIBILITY: Easy access to your stored items including drink lids, food container lids, spice cabinet organizer, snack bars, bathroom accessories, or makeup accessories — that otherwise get lost in a cluttered shelf mess or end up on the bottom of a jumbled storage bin. Wire mesh design provides easy visibility of all your stored items as well. ☑️ VERSATILE: Use Middy Caddies anywhere, in any arrangement, for your organizing needs. Ideal for inside cabinet door storage! Great kitchen cabinet organizer for drink lids, food container lids, spice organization, and other kitchen accessories; pantry door storage; bathroom cabinet organizer; office organization; laundry station organizing; RV organization and storage. Great for apartment storage, dorms, and other temporary storage as well. The possibilities are endless! ☑️ QUALITY CONSTRUCTION; EASY ATTACHMENT: Durable steel construction provides long-lasting reliability, and a Patent-Pending, aesthetically-pleasing design. Middy Caddies attach easily (damage-free) with quality, commercial-grade adhesive. Adhesive provides long-lasting, reliable attachment up to 3lbs! Each Middy Caddy measures 8” long x 3.5” high x 2.25” wide to provide a balance in dimensions, taking up minimal cabinet space while providing more room for your accessories. ☑️ 100% RISK-FREE GUARANTEE: If you are not completely satisfied with your Middy Caddies, we would love the opportunity to make it right, or simply return them hassle-free. We hope your Middy Caddies meet your needs and expectation, and we stand behind your satisfaction more than anything else. Optimize your cabinet space! 🌏 BETTER FOR THE ENVIRONMENT: While many organizers are made of plastic (including acrylic-based plastics), contributing and encouraging more plastic in the home and plastic production in the organization industry, Middy Caddy organizers are a step in the right direction (not much plastic is actually recycled even when put through recycling processes). Middy Caddies help reduce the overwhelming plastic footprint and help the planet! Getting organized and being a part of the movement to reduce the plastic footprint on the environment aren't mutually exclusive. Get organized and help save the planet at the same time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YVj2dTu4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slim Caddy","source_asin":"B0BPHXRGJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPHXRGJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPHXRGJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
