window.products.push({"id":852805,"name":"Dawn Basics Bed Pillows | 1-Pack | Standard Size (20\" x 26\") | Extra-Fluffy Support for Side, Back or Stomach Sleepers | Breathable & Hypoallergenic |","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rnNcryHVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"COMFORT & VALUE: Who says you can't have both? Our Basics Bed Pillows have a breathable 160-thread count microfiber cover, and feature a generous 18 ounces of Comfortlux polyester fiberfill. That's the perfect mix of support and plush fluffy comfort - ideal for side, stomach and back sleepers. Quality materials at an attractive affordable price. BREATHABLE: The Comfortlux fill and pillow cover are both fully breathable, so they don't trap heat or moisture. This gives you a cooler, more comfortable sleep. HYPOALLERGENIC: Made with high-quality, 100% virgin materials, these pillows are completely hypoallergenic. EASY CARE: Unlike many pillows, our Basics Bed Pillows can be machine washed and dried at home. Simply machine wash warm and tumble dry on low heat. They'll come out of your dryer renewed and beautifully fluffy. WHAT YOU GET: One standard-sized bed pillow, measuring 20 inches x 26 inches. Pillow fits all standard-sized pillow cases.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rnNcryHVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dawn","source_asin":"B09RS2J9DK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RS2J9DK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RS2J9DK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":852806,"name":"AdirHome Wooden Wine Rack - 6 Bottle (Cherry)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ewuEGe1BL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you re a connoisseur of wines or someone who just enjoys a good glass of wine with dinner, the AdirHome Wooden Wine Rack will make a strong statement on your impeccable taste . You can proudly display your favorite Cabernet, Merlot, Chardonnay and more anywhere in your home. This AdirHome accessory is beautifully crafted using high-quality wood to provide long-lasting strength and use. The smoothly sculpted wood is cleverly carved with rounded edges , providing the perfect place to store six of your favorite vintages and add a touch of class to your interior space at the same time. To accommodate everyone s taste, the 6-Bottle Wine Rack is available in cherry, espresso and white colors. Each attractive finish will easily complement any interior design , adding a sophisticated look to your home while displaying your bottles of wine for easy identification and retrieval . You can easily put the wine rack together in minutes by installing the metal rods into the pre-existing holes on the cleverly carved wood pieces. While holding the rod with one hand, tighten the cap nut onto the ends of each rod by twisting them with your fingers until secure. It s that easy! No fuss, no muss and no tools! After it s put together, proudly place the AdirHome Wooden Wine Rack anywhere in your home where folks gather for great food, fine wine and good conversation. Storing them in the preferred horizontal position to keep corks moist , this rack will enhance any bar or counter space, buffet table or china closet by creating an elegant appearance anywhere it's placed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ewuEGe1BL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AdirHome","source_asin":"B098RYN8BW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098RYN8BW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098RYN8BW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
