window.products.push({"id":852886,"name":"Home Soft Things Textured Velvet Bedrest Reading Pillow with DIY Filling, Need Assembly, Backrest Armrest Pillow Chair Back Support for Sitting up in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dMuznmKsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FUN DIY ASSEMBLY! Take delight in the DIY filling that is packaged in a vacuum sealed, space-saving reusable bag. Bed rest shell is included in the box, ready to be filled. Easy fill directions create a fun DIY atmosphere and allow you to take pride in your new home addition. Include a personalized message, upon request. RELAX IN COMFORT! Support your neck, back, and arms in comfort with a Textured Velvet Bed Rest! Enjoy your bed rest while watching TV, reading, or relaxing on your bed or couch. They make a great addition to family rooms and kid’s rooms and are easily transported from room to room with the sturdy handle. Sit back, close your eyes, and take pleasure in the support these bed rests provide. THE PERFECT SIZE! Each bedrest measures 20 in x 18 in x 17 in and is offered in solid colors. The size of these bed rest loungers creates the perfect back support for almost anyone. You will find yourself changing positions less frequently since you will remain comfortable for longer periods of time, leaving you refreshed. You’ll see, these bed rest loungers are a bed sent! WELL CRAFTED! Shell is made of 100% Polyester Knitted Fabric and Filling is made of 100% Polyester Fiber. Though your bed rest comes with DIY filling you can rest assured that the quality standards remain the same as all Home Soft Things products. Built to last a lifetime with proper care, crafted with attention to detail, and heat treated for ultimate fade resistance. EASY CARE INSTRUCTIONS! Keeping your bed rest like new is just as easy as the DIY filling. Just remove the filling, and machine wash the shell ONLY. Machine wash separately, using cold water on a gentle cycle. Tumble dry on the lowest heat setting to avoid heat damage. Remove shell from dryer and re-stuff with filling, fluff, and re-use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dMuznmKsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Soft Things","source_asin":"B07WWZ5ZF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WWZ5ZF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WWZ5ZF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":852887,"name":"Pepetools Ultra Series 110MM Flat Rolling Mill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":679.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SmcRJR0ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing the world's best known rolling mill, the \"ultra\" series line of rolling Mills by Pepe tools. pepetools engineered a unique housing that maximizes durability and increases strength, all while decreasing overall mass. Thanks to a new generation of precision machining, pepetools \"ultra\" series rolling Mills are stronger than ever. Frames are fashioned from high strength iron so that the total weight of each mill could be reduced to save on shipping costs. Standard on each mill is a high performance 4:1 reduction gear box turned with a high strength forged steel handle. Gears are not cast but are hobbled from solid steel. Each roll is precision machined from select grades of high density steel. After the machining process is completed, each roll is hardened to 65 hrs. in strategic locations utilizing the latest in induction heat treating methods made in USA rolling mill comes with a 12 month limited factory warranty. Don't miss the opportunity to have this item in your shop. The Half-Round grooves are machined into the upper roll and are used to form Half-Round wire often used to fabricate ring shanks. The 4 square grooves form wire into a profile that is roughly square in profile. Wire so formed is then passed through a drawplate to create round wire or other wire profiles. Holes are provided in the base of the mill for bolting to your workbench. • dimensions: 8-3/4 inch W x 6-3/4 inch d deep x 11-1/4 inch H • gear reduction: 4:1 • shipping weight: 37 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SmcRJR0ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pepe Tools","source_asin":"B01LVUZ8VS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-852887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LVUZ8VS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LVUZ8VS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
